  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Migrantland:  A base for the future</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">There are over 2 million Migrant Workers on the Thai/Myanmar border who work under slave-like conditions in Thai factories and farms, most often for less than half of minimum wage.  These workers are harassed, scammed, trafficked, exploited and extorted by Thai police and other authorities. Yet they continue to cross the border for work to avoid starvation in Myanmar. Addiction and violence are rife in this population due to the extreme abuse they have suffered.</narrative>
  </description>
